{"meta":{"id":"err-archive:1079089","type":"series","name":"Järjejutt. Indrek Hargla \"Raudhammas\"","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2026/09/02/3791299hd499t80.webp","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585h8d7ct48.jpg","genres":["Raadioteater"],"description":"Noor ajaloolane Kalev asub elama Kopenhaagenisse, kuna ta naisele Karolale pakutakse seal tööd Eesti saatkonnas. Kalev, kes endale õiget rakendust ei leia, saab tuttavaks väikese sõpruskonnaga, keda huvitab viikingiaeg. Peagi selgub, et taanlaste jaoks pole see lihtsalt hobi või rollimäng – nad on avastanud ruunikivi, mille abil võimalik teha ajareise minevikku. Seikluslikku novelli loeb Tambet Tuisk.","videos":[{"id":"err-archive:1079091","title":"Indrek Hargla. \"Raudhammas\"","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585hb21bt34.jpg","released":"2020-04-18"},{"id":"err-archive:1079092","title":"Indrek Hargla. \"Raudhammas\"","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585hb21bt34.jpg","released":"2020-04-18"},{"id":"err-archive:1079093","title":"Indrek Hargla. \"Raudhammas\"","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585hb21bt34.jpg","released":"2020-04-18"},{"id":"err-archive:1079094","title":"Indrek Hargla. \"Raudhammas\"","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585hb21bt34.jpg","released":"2020-04-18"},{"id":"err-archive:1079095","title":"Indrek Hargla. \"Raudhammas\"","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2013/04/21/128585hb21bt34.jpg","released":"2020-04-18"}]}}